sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Browser UI
  participant API as Next API
  participant AI as StepFun
  participant DB as SQLite
  User->>UI: 选择食物图片
  UI->>API: POST /api/ai/recognize
  API->>AI: 服务端凭据调用
  AI-->>API: 结构化食物候选
  API-->>UI: data/error
  UI-->>User: 展示可编辑审核单
  User->>UI: 确认保存
  UI->>API: POST /api/meals
  API->>DB: 绑定 primary profile 后写入
  DB-->>API: 已保存记录
  API-->>UI: data/error
